			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3C5EB45848DA6797"]
			description: ["A CPU wafer treated in an EV chemical reactor becomes a &6Nano CPU Wafer&r, and the laser engraver cuts it into chips. A working cleanroom, carbon fibers and the HV wafer line behind you. The nanoprocessor, and with it the whole nano ladder. Cleanroom hatches take wafers from the ME network and return chips to it."]
			icon: "gtceu:nano_cpu_wafer"
