		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5AB977D135E31355"]
			description: ["The phosphorus wafer becomes an &6MPIC Wafer&r and the engraver cuts the &6MPIC Chips&r out of it. A laser engraver and the right lens. Real EV energy and dynamo hatches. A wafer in, chips out. Let ME feed the engraver and store the chips."]
			icon: "gtceu:mpic_chip"
