			dependencies: ["3C5EB45848DA6797", "7ECBC918EE387EB6"]
			description: ["The &6Nanoprocessor&r is the nano line's HV circuit, and only the EV circuit assembler can put one together. Nano CPU chips, carbon fibers and the usual SMD parts. The assembly, and every EV machine that wants circuits. Run it from the assembler's own pattern, with the chips delivered by ME."]
